# MacNeutron's native arm64 stack inputs (native arm64 spec §5.1, §6.1), sourced by wine-arm64/build.sh.
# Wine: this one commit of our fork's WINE_BRANCH (upstream master with our changes, the VM's included; build.sh
# fetches it alone). The VM's Wine is the same tree (eac-vm/wine/sync.sh). llvm-mingw is not pinned here: dxmt/pins
# owns it, via dxmt/toolchain.sh.
